@startuml
hide footbox
actor Mahasiswa
boundary "Halaman Logbook Harian"
control "Control Logbook Harian"
database "Database Logbook"

Mahasiswa -> "Halaman Logbook Harian": Membuka logbook harian
"Halaman Logbook Harian" -> "Control Logbook Harian": Minta form logbook harian
"Control Logbook Harian" -> "Database Logbook": Ambil data program dan template logbook
"Database Logbook" --> "Control Logbook Harian": Data template logbook
"Control Logbook Harian" -> "Halaman Logbook Harian": Kirim form isian logbook
"Halaman Logbook Harian" -> Mahasiswa: Tampilkan form isian logbook

Mahasiswa -> "Halaman Logbook Harian": Mengisi aktivitas harian
Mahasiswa -> "Halaman Logbook Harian": Mengunggah dokumentasi
Mahasiswa -> "Halaman Logbook Harian": Menekan tombol simpan

"Halaman Logbook Harian" -> "Control Logbook Harian": Kirim data logbook harian
"Control Logbook Harian" -> "Control Logbook Harian": Validasi kelengkapan data

alt Data valid
    "Control Logbook Harian" -> "Database Logbook": Simpan data logbook harian
    "Database Logbook" --> "Control Logbook Harian": Konfirmasi penyimpanan berhasil
    "Control Logbook Harian" -> "Database Logbook": Update status logbook (menunggu verifikasi)
    "Control Logbook Harian" -> "Halaman Logbook Harian": Kirim notifikasi sukses
    "Halaman Logbook Harian" -> Mahasiswa: Tampilkan notifikasi sukses
    "Halaman Logbook Harian" -> Mahasiswa: Tampilkan status "menunggu verifikasi pamong"
else Data tidak valid
    "Control Logbook Harian" -> "Halaman Logbook Harian": Kirim pesan error validasi
    "Halaman Logbook Harian" -> Mahasiswa: Tampilkan pesan error validasi
end
@enduml 